    "body": "Cool. I am at a conference right now and I believe one of the authors on that paper are also here. I will try to track them down and ask if they'd be willing to share any of their code.\r\n\r\nI think it is important to note that while 1510.04048 seems easier to implement than the latter two papers, the technique has the unfortunate consequence of increasing the number of terms in the Hamiltonian exponentially. Thus, it is really only of academic interest at this point. The techniques introduced in 1701.08213 and 1712.07067 are efficient.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
