    "updated_at": "2018-02-06T05:29:26Z",
    "body": "we've been working on my fork, so starting there could be helpful.\r\neverything is living under simplifications for now and can be moved anywhere. \r\nthe code functions, but needs additional love and care. \r\n\r\nthere are two new operators, \r\n  symbolic_binary -> for decoder \r\n  code_operator -> (encoder,decoder) pair.  [-- or (e,d) from the paper.]\r\nthe code_operator is used for the transformation.\r\n\r\n_code_operator_transform.py has the transform function that takes a fermionOperator and a _code_ and gives out the QubitOperator, corresponding to that _code_ applied on the fermionOperator. \r\n\r\ndecoder_encoder_functions.py has sample _codes_\r\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
